  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<align="right">dec 18, 2024</align>


    Hey <b><i>redacted</i></b>.
    i should really be studying right now but lets be honest, it gets boring af.
    also apologies in advance if this letter feels a little disjointed at times.
    im writing whatever comes to mind. you are so kind, smart, and beautiful. that
    is why i have deployed a carrier pigeon to hand you this letter. to say im nervous
    is a little bit of an understatement. anyways... i was wondering if you would
    be down to get to know each a little more. :D



    of course i fully understand
    if you dont and thats completely fine. i dont want to put you in any type of
    uncomfortable situations. thats why i wrote this letter! so you wont have to
    be put in this awkward position of saying no if i asked you in person. after
    that you can just throw out this letter, rip it to shreds,  or whatever to your
    hearts content.



    but jusssssst in case you dont feel like discarding this
    letter just yet, ive written my phone number below. im going to be honest. you
    could probably find out my name behind the number by simply asking around, but
    what fun is life without a little mystery? ;D

'
